(7428660, 1173153, 75618, '<td valign="top">This feels like the door to Narnia, or somewhere full of endless possibilities. Love the perfect placement of the white arrow and the shoe, a hint of an adult left behind in the "real" world. 10</td>', 'This feels like the door to Narnia, or somewhere full of endless possibilities. Love the perfect placement of the white arrow and the shoe, a hint of an adult left behind in the "real" world. 10', '2016-01-16 08:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7428661, 1173566, 75618, '<td valign="top">Very bold choices. The anonymity and mystery created by blocking the face and the black bars really make this much more interesting than your typical portrait. He still evokes such humility and grace even without the face showing.  9</td>', 'Very bold choices. The anonymity and mystery created by blocking the face and the black bars really make this much more interesting than your typical portrait. He still evokes such humility and grace even without the face showing.  9', '2016-01-16 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7428662, 1173332, 75618, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m staring at a lump of sand and the images just start to form effortlessly. It''s uncertain if the figures really exist or they''re just a figment of my imagination. 9</td>', 'I feel like I''m staring at a lump of sand and the images just start to form effortlessly. It''s uncertain if the figures really exist or they''re just a figment of my imagination. 9', '2016-01-16 08:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
