(7429022, 1173673, 156466, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and striking photo. Really lovely. It leaves me wondering how the processing holds up to Advanced Edit scrutiny, but ultimately that doesn''t matter - the result it wonderful.</td>', 'Very interesting and striking photo. Really lovely. It leaves me wondering how the processing holds up to Advanced Edit scrutiny, but ultimately that doesn''t matter - the result it wonderful.', '2016-01-17 07:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429023, 1173608, 156466, '<td valign="top">Rob is this you?  Outstanding.</td>', 'Rob is this you?  Outstanding.', '2016-01-17 07:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429024, 1173144, 156466, '<td valign="top">Very interesting treatment.  Almost creepy, which when I read the title I suspect wasn''t what you were going for.  Perhaps it''s because the child reminded me immediately of this lifesized doll we had in the house growing up, "Baby John", that my Mom would dress up rather bizarrely and place around the house.  Art is supposed to evoke a reaction and yours certainly did.</td>', 'Very interesting treatment.  Almost creepy, which when I read the title I suspect wasn''t what you were going for.  Perhaps it''s because the child reminded me immediately of this lifesized doll we had in the house growing up, "Baby John", that my Mom would dress up rather bizarrely and place around the house.  Art is supposed to evoke a reaction and yours certainly did.', '2016-01-17 07:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429025, 1173153, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and the arrow makes it for me.</td>', 'Great shot, and the arrow makes it for me.', '2016-01-17 07:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429026, 1173689, 156466, '<td valign="top">I actually like that this isn''t centered, which is amazing given my OCD with stuff like this.  Really nice.</td>', 'I actually like that this isn''t centered, which is amazing given my OCD with stuff like this.  Really nice.', '2016-01-17 07:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429027, 1173401, 156466, '<td valign="top">Evoked a memory of Pink Floyd''s "Ummagumma" cover for some reason.  Very nice.</td>', 'Evoked a memory of Pink Floyd''s "Ummagumma" cover for some reason.  Very nice.', '2016-01-17 07:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429028, 1173492, 156466, '<td valign="top">Wonderful</td>', 'Wonderful', '2016-01-17 07:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429034, 1173257, 156466, '<td valign="top">Very, very striking, and with a punny title to boot.  Strong structuring works great on the building but has left you with a lot of haloing in the sky that I wish you''d cleaned up/kept under control.  Still a wonderful image.</td>', 'Very, very striking, and with a punny title to boot.  Strong structuring works great on the building but has left you with a lot of haloing in the sky that I wish you''d cleaned up/kept under control.  Still a wonderful image.', '2016-01-17 08:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429068, 1173453, 100831, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this... a sensitive, trained eye only would notice and care to shoot a view such as this one. Out of season, lonely and poetic but I find hope here... 8</td>', 'I keep coming back to this... a sensitive, trained eye only would notice and care to shoot a view such as this one. Out of season, lonely and poetic but I find hope here... 8', '2016-01-17 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
