(7429173, 1173689, 65858, '<td valign="top">The nearly perfect symmetry, the tones, and the speckeled dusty texture make this one of my favorites. Most of all, I love the way it feels like it''s drawing you in and pointing the way to something.<br/> <br/>Congratulations, our DPC League team, ImageNation, has selected your image for an Honorable Mention in our Art of 2015 awards:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1174109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png"/></a></td>', 'The nearly perfect symmetry, the tones, and the speckeled dusty texture make this one of my favorites. Most of all, I love the way it feels like it''s drawing you in and pointing the way to something. Congratulations, our DPC League team, ImageNation, has selected your image for an Honorable Mention in our Art of 2015 awards: ', '2016-01-17 14:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429184, 1173250, 30861, '<td valign="top">Such a haunting, even foreboding, variation on the them of a girl and her pony. Her expression is deliciously enigmatic. I award the Golden Bear Paw to this image.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762723" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Such a haunting, even foreboding, variation on the them of a girl and her pony. Her expression is deliciously enigmatic. I award the Golden Bear Paw to this image. ', '2016-01-17 15:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
