(7429313, 1173453, 38032, '<td valign="top">riveting. will come back for more later.<br/>OK. I''m back. The complementary colors are candy. The blurred motion of the snow is just right to add a dreamy natural texture. The clean processing on the railings reminds a David Hockney painting. And McDonalds. The shadowy reflection on the right is ominous while the mysterious object on the left keeps us in reality and out of a dream. The composition is balanced and the eyes can''t help but jump around with wonder.<br/> <br/>Congrats, you are my personal selection for an Honorable Mention from the ImageNation Jury awards!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1174109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png"/></a></td>', 'riveting. will come back for more later.OK. I''m back. The complementary colors are candy. The blurred motion of the snow is just right to add a dreamy natural texture. The clean processing on the railings reminds a David Hockney painting. And McDonalds. The shadowy reflection on the right is ominous while the mysterious object on the left keeps us in reality and out of a dream. The composition is balanced and the eyes can''t help but jump around with wonder. Congrats, you are my personal selection for an Honorable Mention from the ImageNation Jury awards!', '2016-01-17 20:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
