(7429374, 1173250, 50695, '<td valign="top">reminds me of Diane Arbus. The way her legs fade off, probably due to vignetting and perhaps lens distortion, make her head and hands seem big (and also because they''re brightly lit in a dark scene), and I think that adds to the Arbus effect, at least in my head. She has none of the pain (anomie?) of an Arbus character, though. She seems perfectly happy to be standing where she is. Her expression is one of temporary resolve. She will soon be ready for the next thing. Still, she utterly succeeds as the main character of a photograph, unconsciously heroic, ready to get on her donkey and conquer the world.</td>', 'reminds me of Diane Arbus. The way her legs fade off, probably due to vignetting and perhaps lens distortion, make her head and hands seem big (and also because they''re brightly lit in a dark scene), and I think that adds to the Arbus effect, at least in my head. She has none of the pain (anomie?) of an Arbus character, though. She seems perfectly happy to be standing where she is. Her expression is one of temporary resolve. She will soon be ready for the next thing. Still, she utterly succeeds as the main character of a photograph, unconsciously heroic, ready to get on her donkey and conquer the world.', '2016-01-17 21:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429375, 1173654, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s so out of place. The photo creates a cyclical experience in the viewer. I start thinking Why am I looking at this table? and then suddenly I realize this face is on the table... until I forget again.</td>', 'It''s so out of place. The photo creates a cyclical experience in the viewer. I start thinking Why am I looking at this table? and then suddenly I realize this face is on the table... until I forget again.', '2016-01-17 21:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429376, 1173634, 50695, '<td valign="top">a beautiful candid, a beautiful architecture shot, a beautiful street shot, but is it art? of course it is. It reminds me of some of the first photographs, it is at the center of what photography does, and photography is an art.</td>', 'a beautiful candid, a beautiful architecture shot, a beautiful street shot, but is it art? of course it is. It reminds me of some of the first photographs, it is at the center of what photography does, and photography is an art.', '2016-01-17 21:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
