(7429378, 1173208, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig<br/> <br/>is awarded to this composition for excellence in tone, line, &amp; form. Thank you for an abstract that is interesting to look at as a whole &amp; fascinating in its detail.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-01-18 07:22:47.</i></td>', ' The Flying Pig is awarded to this composition for excellence in tone, line, & form. Thank you for an abstract that is interesting to look at as a whole & fascinating in its detail.', '2016-01-17 21:45:19.000000', '2016-01-18 07:22:47.000000', 1),
