(7429381, 1173208, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh yes, a great example of photographic Cubism<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'oh yes, a great example of photographic Cubism I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2016-01-17 21:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429382, 1173603, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is utterly Surreal. The "robes" appear to be nothing more than sheets tied at his chest, but they feel authentic nonetheless, helped no doubt by the blank expression and the faraway mustache. This is like a lunatic''s reenactment of Lawrence of Arabia, but the sun is playing along.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'this is utterly Surreal. The "robes" appear to be nothing more than sheets tied at his chest, but they feel authentic nonetheless, helped no doubt by the blank expression and the faraway mustache. This is like a lunatic''s reenactment of Lawrence of Arabia, but the sun is playing along.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2016-01-17 21:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
