(7429400, 1173401, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1046796" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1046796.jpg"/></a> <br/>The Flying Pig Honorable Mention<br/> <br/>is awarded to this composition of doorways. The abstract qualities natural to a doorway are beautifully enhanced by the camera angle &amp; point of view. The light &amp; shadow lead me into the scene to the window at the end. Thank you for a composition that is both interesting &amp; meditational to look at.</td>', ' The Flying Pig Honorable Mention is awarded to this composition of doorways. The abstract qualities natural to a doorway are beautifully enhanced by the camera angle & point of view. The light & shadow lead me into the scene to the window at the end. Thank you for a composition that is both interesting & meditational to look at.', '2016-01-17 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
