(7429642, 1173595, 19825, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the lesson. I struggle to with high key images, and you have provided me with such an excellent example of how to do it well.</td>', 'Thanks for the lesson. I struggle to with high key images, and you have provided me with such an excellent example of how to do it well.', '2016-01-18 11:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7429643, 1173280, 19825, '<td valign="top">This finished much higher in my list. Of course, I walk this stairway a few times a year. Still, it is an excellent composition. I do think Susan''s suggestion of putting a human element somewhere in the frame might have added a bit of interest. I tend to find myself doing that quite a bit -- finding an interesting spot and then waiting (impatiently) for the right person to walk into it.</td>', 'This finished much higher in my list. Of course, I walk this stairway a few times a year. Still, it is an excellent composition. I do think Susan''s suggestion of putting a human element somewhere in the frame might have added a bit of interest. I tend to find myself doing that quite a bit -- finding an interesting spot and then waiting (impatiently) for the right person to walk into it.', '2016-01-18 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
