(7429669, 1173597, 38032, '<td valign="top">There is a beauty, innocence, and a haphazard nature to the construction here. It has hints of abandonment but is clearly cared-for and charming in its own right. As a person who has visited Italy twice, this feels true to its nature.<br/> <br/>The open-air shutters, weathered paint, modern amenities seemingly added after construction but before the most recent paint-job  And then the potted flowers to being it all into the now. A wonderful composition to behold.</td>', 'There is a beauty, innocence, and a haphazard nature to the construction here. It has hints of abandonment but is clearly cared-for and charming in its own right. As a person who has visited Italy twice, this feels true to its nature. The open-air shutters, weathered paint, modern amenities seemingly added after construction but before the most recent paint-job  And then the potted flowers to being it all into the now. A wonderful composition to behold.', '2016-01-18 12:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
