(7429964, 1173595, 16912, '<td valign="top">This should have been posted before rollover Susan (it was decided prior to rollover though).<br/> <br/>It is with great pleasure that I give you this bit of <b>ImageNation</b> bling as an individual HM from myself. It was one of my top 5 choices but sadly my team members couldn''t grasp the artistic beauty in this shot.<br/> <br/>I like so much about this image and feel the high key effect transforms the image and allows the viewer to fll in the gaps to tell the Ponies story.<br/> <br/>Others have mentioned the lack of pure black especially around the hooves and whilst I agree I still think this adds to the image and it''s ''Artistic'' value.<br/> <br/>Well done Susan, 11th in a ''Best of'' and  (currently) 3 favs isn''t to be sniffed at.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1174109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174109.png"/></a></td>', 'This should have been posted before rollover Susan (it was decided prior to rollover though). It is with great pleasure that I give you this bit of ImageNation bling as an individual HM from myself. It was one of my top 5 choices but sadly my team members couldn''t grasp the artistic beauty in this shot. I like so much about this image and feel the high key effect transforms the image and allows the viewer to fll in the gaps to tell the Ponies story. Others have mentioned the lack of pure black especially around the hooves and whilst I agree I still think this adds to the image and it''s ''Artistic'' value. Well done Susan, 11th in a ''Best of'' and  (currently) 3 favs isn''t to be sniffed at. ', '2016-01-19 13:32:19.000000', NULL, 0),
