(7431662, 1173579, 150277, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>I liked this image and gave it a 6 during voting.  I had seen the bird seed as sand and thought the ''waves'' were lovely.  The single child in the photograph added to its impact for me.  The only thing that I didn''t love about the image was the bare pink space behind the child.  I''m not sure I can think what you might have done about it if this was a found shot.  But overall I thought the image was a strong entry for the Art challenge.</td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club. I liked this image and gave it a 6 during voting.  I had seen the bird seed as sand and thought the ''waves'' were lovely.  The single child in the photograph added to its impact for me.  The only thing that I didn''t love about the image was the bare pink space behind the child.  I''m not sure I can think what you might have done about it if this was a found shot.  But overall I thought the image was a strong entry for the Art challenge.', '2016-01-25 10:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7434036, 1173620, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very nice image indeed!</td>', 'Very nice image indeed!', '2016-02-01 18:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
